p you informed, not confused.\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n					        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n                            <h3>\n                    Our Approach                </h3>\n                        		  	<p>We cut through the noise. Every article, review, and tool on PC Pulse is built on real research and hands-on testing — not hype, not guesswork. We simplify complex tech so you can make confident decisions, fast.</p>\n					        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n                            <h3>\n                    Our Values                </h3>\n                        		  	<p><b>Accuracy first</b>. We verify before we publish.\nIndependence always. Our opinions are our own — no sponsored bias.\nAccessibility for all. Whether you\'re a beginner or an expert, our content meets you where you are.</p>\n					        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n                            <h3>\n                    Our Support                </h3>\n                        		  	<p>Got a question, a correction, or just want to chat tech? We\'re real people who read every message. </p>\n					        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n                            <h3>\n                    Our Resources                </h3>\n                        		  	<p>From breaking tech news and in-depth reviews to our interactive PC Builder tool, everything you need to stay informed and build smart lives right here — constantly updated, always free to access.</p>\n												0\n																			+\n					<h3>Satisfied Clients</h3>								\n												0\n																			+\n					<h3>Completed Projects</h3>								\n												0\n																			+\n					<h3>Years of Experience</h3>								\n												0\n																			+\n					<h3>Professional Team</h3>','About Us','','inherit','closed','closed','','104-revision-v1','','','2026-06-25 08: